@startuml tui-shell-and-editor-component
title ide-tui (T1) — component relationships

package "crates/tui (ide-tui)" {
  [main.rs] as Main
  [app.rs\nApp / Focus] as App
  [tree.rs\nTreeState] as Tree
  [editor.rs\nmove_cursor] as Editor
  [commands.rs\nregistry] as Commands
  [ui.rs\nrender (pure)] as Ui
}

package "crates/core (ide-core)" {
  [Project / DirEntry] as Project
  [Buffer] as Buffer
  [TextBuffer / Selections / LineIndex] as TextBuffer
}

package "external" {
  [ratatui] as Ratatui
  [crossterm] as Crossterm
}

Main --> App : constructs, drives main loop
Main --> Crossterm : raw mode, alt screen, event poll/read
Main --> Ratatui : Terminal::draw

App --> Tree : visible_rows / move_selection
App --> Editor : move_cursor
App --> Commands : binding_for / dispatch
App --> Project : open, scan_tree
App --> Buffer : open, insert, delete, save, undo, redo

Tree --> Project : reads DirEntry tree
Editor --> TextBuffer : line/column <-> offset
Buffer --> TextBuffer : wraps

Ui --> App : reads state only (no mutation)
Ui --> Ratatui : List / Paragraph / Clear widgets

note right of App
  ide-ui (crates/ui) is a peer frontend,
  not a dependency in either direction.
end note

@enduml
